OL,3,GNEWSACruel hare coursers leave 22 dead
OL,4,Aanimals at farm
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's horrible. It's just pure animal
OL,7,Fcruelty," says a farmer in east Kent
OL,8,Fwho found 22 dead hares laid out in
OL,9,Frows in a field.
OL,11,F"Some of those hares would have been
OL,12,Ffeeding their young which will now die
OL,13,Fas well."
OL,15,FThe farmer, who we are calling Sarah,
OL,16,Fasked not be be named for fear of
OL,17,Freprisals.
OL,19,F"The idea that animals are pursued for
OL,20,Ffun or for financial gain is
OL,21,Fdisgusting," she added.
